# Build-context filter for apps/web/Dockerfile only (BuildKit per-Dockerfile ignore file),
# so the repository root .dockerignore stays free for other work streams.
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
.git
backend
mobile
infra
docs
apps/web/public/vendor
